<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Project Sdk="Dalamud.NET.Sdk/15.0.0">
  <!-- Project settings -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Name>Scrollable Tabs</Name>
    <Version>1.2.0</Version>
    <Author>Haselnussbomber</Author>
    <RepoUrl>https://github.com/Haselnussbomber/ScrollableTabs</RepoUrl>
    <Punchline>Lets you use the mouse wheel to switch tabs (like LB/RB on controllers do).</Punchline>
    <Description>Lets you use the mouse wheel to switch tabs (like LB/RB on controllers do).

The following windows are supported and can be toggled individually:

- Aether Currents
- Armoury Chest
- Blue Magic Spellbook
- Character
- Character -&gt; Classes/Jobs
- Character -&gt; Reputation
- Chocobo Saddlebag
- Companion
- Currency
- Facewear
- Fashion Accessories
- Field Records
- Fish Guide
- Glamour Dresser (scrolls pages, not tabs)
- Gold Saucer -&gt; Card List
- Gold Saucer -&gt; Decks -&gt; Edit Deck
- Gold Saucer -&gt; Lord of Verminion -&gt; Minion Hotbar
- Icons
- Inventory
- Island Minion Guide
- Master's Bestiary
- Minions
- Mounts
- Retainer Inventory
- Shared FATE
- Sightseeing Log

The Command Panel already includes this functionality and instead has an option to disable its tab-scrolling sound effect.</Description>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- Build settings -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputPath>..\bin\</OutputPath>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- Assets -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Condition="'$(Configuration)' == 'Debug'" Include="Assets\Icon.png" Link="images\icon.png" CopyToOutputDirectory="PreserveNewest" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!-- NuGet dependencies -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Roslynator.Analyzers" Version="4.16.1" PrivateAssets="all" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
